            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Acidic Pustules"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The marauder's skin is covered with necrotic boils that burst when struck. Whenever a creature deals slashing or piercing damage to the marauder, each creature within 5 feet takes 2d6 acid damage (22 basic Reflex save). On a critically failed save, a creature also takes 1d4 persistent acid damage."
